      "message": "DONTMERGE! net: Reproducer with forced chunked recv\n\nA stress test reproducer. For every socket read, read data in smaller\nrecv() calls.\nInstead of performing a recv for up to the available buffer size normally,\ndo separate recv()'s for each byte, in order to stress test code paths.\nIf there is a large amount of data available (more than 100 bytes),\nuse larger chunks, by reading a third of the available size.\nWARNING: Only for testing purposes, not to be merged!",
